  "ingredients": [
    "1 (2 pound) venison backstrap, cut into 1/4 inch thick slices",
    "2.5 cups milk, divided",
    "2 tablespoons hot pepper sauce",
    "3 cups vegetable oil for frying",
    "3 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2 tablespoons salt",
    "1 tablespoon ground black pepper",
    "2 eggs"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place venison slices into a shallow bowl and pour in 2 cups milk and hot sauce. Stir to coat, then cover and marinate for 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/igilq_H0DtJ3NnQT9apSMNJPJoQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/131713-fried-venison-backstrap-Step1-0440-f39451a38f844c85b4e038838c07bfb8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/131713/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat vegetable oil in an electric fryer or skillet to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Set up a dredging station: Stir together flour, salt, and pepper in a shallow bowl. Whisk eggs and remaining 1/2 cup milk together in a separate shallow bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4WZqwvOFXyq1vk272AMJ8npbD98=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/131713-fried-venison-backstrap-Step2-0443-1de4bcd4b7c344b8b938fe82d37b78ea.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/131713/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dip venison slices into the flour mixture, then into the egg mixture, then back into the flour mixture. Shake off excess flour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kFiLj3T57G8t7la_0-m8fKLpxCY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/131713-fried-venison-backstrap-Step3-0445-9cf5d09c1ffd42e8803b7e72cf503285.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/131713/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fry in the hot oil until lightly browned on each side, about 3 minutes. Remove with tongs and drain briefly on paper towels before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ikGVVVqMYLKBqcwF68Cy6gRt05E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/131713-fried-venison-backstrap-Step4-0446-0ac5dd8608684391a2efbede97b079fb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/131713/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
